# SOC2 audit engagement phase 10 (TERMINAL): Auditor Report Handoff —
# Arclight Cloud Platform case study. One domain FRAGMENT of the shared
# arclight-soc2-audit-cycle domain: this phase's 3 actions chain
# evidence-bundle-assembled -> report-handoff-step1-done -> report-handoff-step2-done -> evidence-bundle-complete,
# so the merged cycle plan can only reach this phase after Phase 9
# (Evidence Bundle Assembly) completes. 8-constraint split: every
# precondition/effect/goal here is a 1-conjunct (and ...) — far inside
# PDDL8_MAX_CONJUNCTS=8 — and each action takes 1 parameter
# (PDDL8_MAX_PARAMS=8); soc2_test.rs asserts these bounds mechanically for
# every fragment (reusing crate::bench::togaf::verify_eight_constraint_split
# verbatim).
#
# COMPLIANCE-OVERCLAIM FENCE (this fragment carries the terminal goal
# atom, so read this carefully): the deliverable of this TERMINAL phase is
# the assembled evidence bundle itself, handed to a human auditor for
# their professional judgment — this pipeline produces NO opinion and NO
# compliance verdict. The terminal effect atom is named
# "evidence-bundle-complete", deliberately NOT "compliant" or
# "opinion-issued" — no such atom exists anywhere in this domain.
# soc2_test.rs mechanically greps the parsed, merged Pddl8Domain's action
# effects for "compliant"/"opinion" substrings and asserts zero matches;
# this is the structural enforcement point for that check, not just prose.
# See packs/soc2-audit-pack/ontology.ttl for the full fence disclosure.
#
# Public-ontology doctrine: the artifact node is a blank node; the phase is
# identified by its public SKOS notation. The only private predicate is
# the cng pipeline's ABI carrier ceng:pddlDomain (urn:chatman:engine#),
# disclosed in packs/soc2-audit-pack/ontology.ttl.
@prefix ceng:    <urn:chatman:engine#> .
@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

_:artifact
    skos:notation "AUDIT-REPORT-HANDOFF" ;
    dcterms:description "Auditor Report Handoff (terminal) domain fragment of the arclight-soc2-audit-cycle STRIPS domain."@en ;
    ceng:pddlDomain """
(define (domain arclight-soc2-audit-cycle)
  (:requirements :strips)
  (:predicates
    (evidence-bundle-assembled ?x)
    (report-handoff-step1-done ?x)
    (report-handoff-step2-done ?x)
    (evidence-bundle-complete ?x))
  (:action package-evidence-bundle-for-handoff
    :parameters (?x)
    :precondition (and (evidence-bundle-assembled ?x))
    :effect (and (report-handoff-step1-done ?x)))
  (:action transfer-custody-to-auditor
    :parameters (?x)
    :precondition (and (report-handoff-step1-done ?x))
    :effect (and (report-handoff-step2-done ?x)))
  (:action confirm-evidence-bundle-complete
    :parameters (?x)
    :precondition (and (report-handoff-step2-done ?x))
    :effect (and (evidence-bundle-complete ?x))))
""" .
